# Environment.
# `.env` and `.env.production` are intentionally tracked: they contain only
# non-secret, build-time Vite config (VITE_* values are inlined into the
# bundle and are therefore public by definition). Anything genuinely secret
# belongs in one of the *.local overrides below, which are never committed.
.env.local
.env.*.local

